  "Name": "JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE HD Ver.",
  "Overview": "JoJo's Bizarre Adventure: HD Ver. is a HD version of the 1998 arcade game JoJo's Bizarre Adventure. Players can select the original pixels or a new high-definition version with filters similar to those used in Street Fighter III: Third Strike - Online Edition. It also has multiplayer network support for these console versions with Ranked and Player Matches in addition to a lobby system, for eight players, that can be customised with private slots and room names. There is a spectator function and replays can be saved and viewed.\n\nThe main Story Mode does not include the Super Story Mode and its mini-games from the PlayStation version. Next to the Training room there is a Challenge Mode that lets you choose between a health or super boost between fights with the main goal to survive as long as possible on a single health bar.",
